% The contract obligation within days starts: its first obligations.
when the contract obligation within days starts on day a day with party a party and action an action and deadline a deadline
    and a due day = day + deadline
then obligation within days obliges the party to do anything by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract required steps procedure starts: its first obligations.
when the contract required steps procedure starts on day a day with charity a charity and notice a notice
    and a due day = day + 30
then required steps procedure obliges commissioner_actor to serve required steps notice by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity and notice the notice.

% The contract payment with grace starts: its first obligations.
when the contract payment with grace starts on day a day with debtor a debtor and amount an amount and due date a due date and grace period a grace period and late fee pct a late fee pct
    and a due day = day + due date
then payment with grace obliges the debtor to pay by day the due day as its first obligation given amount the amount and debtor the debtor and due date the due date and grace period the grace period and late fee pct the late fee pct.

% The contract escalation chain starts: its first obligations.
when the contract escalation chain starts on day a day with subject a subject
then escalation chain permits regulatory_body to issue warning as its first obligation given subject the subject.

% The contract enforcement response starts: its first obligations.
when the contract enforcement response starts on day a day with violation a violation and subject a subject
    and the severity of the violation is a value
    and the value is equal to critical
then enforcement response obliges regulatory_body to suspend immediately as its first obligation.

when the contract enforcement response starts on day a day with violation a violation and subject a subject
    and the severity of the violation is a value
    and the value is different from critical
    and the severity of the violation is a second value
    and the second value is equal to serious
then enforcement response permits regulatory_body to impose fine as its second obligation given subject the subject.

when the contract enforcement response starts on day a day with violation a violation and subject a subject
    and the severity of the violation is a value
    and the value is different from critical
    and the severity of the violation is a second value
    and the second value is different from serious
then escalation chain permits regulatory_body to issue warning as its first obligation given subject the subject.

% The contract licence renewal procedure starts: its first obligations.
when the contract licence renewal procedure starts on day a day with holder a holder and expiry date an expiry date
    and a thing = expiry date - 30
    and a due day = day + thing
then licence renewal procedure obliges the holder to apply for renewal by day the due day as its first obligation given expiry date the expiry date and holder the holder.

% The first obligation of obligation within days: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does something on day a day
    and obligation within days obliges the party to do anything by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that obligation within days obliges the party to do anything by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and obligation within days obliges a party to do anything by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached
    and it is not the case that obligation within days obliges the party to do anything by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of required steps procedure: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does serve required steps notice on day a day
    and required steps procedure obliges the party to serve required steps notice by day a due day as its first obligation given charity a charity and notice a notice
    and the day <= the due day
    and a second party is the charity actor of the charity
    and the deadline of the notice is a value
    and a second due day = day + value
then required steps procedure obliges the second party to take required steps by day the second due day as its second obligation given charity the charity
    and it is not the case that required steps procedure obliges the party to serve required steps notice by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity and notice the notice.

when something happens on day a day
    and required steps procedure obliges a party to serve required steps notice by day a due day as its first obligation given charity a charity and notice a notice
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by commissioner_actor because "failed to serve notice"
    and it is not the case that required steps procedure obliges the party to serve required steps notice by day the due day as its first obligation given charity the charity and notice the notice.

% The first obligation of payment with grace: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does pay with payment amount a payment amount on day a day
    and payment with grace obliges the party to pay by day a due day as its first obligation given amount an amount and debtor a debtor and due date a due date and grace period a grace period and late fee pct a late fee pct
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that payment with grace obliges the party to pay by day the due day as its first obligation given amount the amount and debtor the debtor and due date the due date and grace period the grace period and late fee pct the late fee pct.

when something happens on day a day
    and payment with grace obliges a party to pay by day a due day as its first obligation given amount an amount and debtor a debtor and due date a due date and grace period a grace period and late fee pct a late fee pct
    and the day > the due day
    and a thing = due date + grace period
    and a second due day = day + thing
then payment with grace obliges the debtor to pay with late fee by day the second due day as its second obligation given debtor the debtor
    and it is not the case that payment with grace obliges the party to pay by day the due day as its first obligation given amount the amount and debtor the debtor and due date the due date and grace period the grace period and late fee pct the late fee pct.

% The first obligation of escalation chain: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does issue warning on day a day
    and escalation chain permits the party to issue warning as its first obligation given subject a subject
    and a due day = day + 30
then escalation chain obliges the subject to comply with warning by day the due day as its second obligation given subject the subject
    and it is not the case that escalation chain permits the party to issue warning as its first obligation given subject the subject.

% The first obligation of enforcement response: met, or its deadline missed.
